{"id": "zh-da0610bd-0067", "text": "首先复现失败，然后把日志级别调到调试，最后再定位到具体的代码行，这三步是有严格顺序的，跳步往往会白费时间。按这个流程走，大多数偶发问题都能在两轮之内收敛。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 77, "topic_id": "da0610bd-neg-zh-steps2-47", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "da0610bd-1b0f-4594-b8a4-05684632afda", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "首先", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-da0610bd-0068", "text": "这个模型精度高，但推理也慢，两者是同时成立的，所以部署时要根据场景在速度和准确率之间做取舍。对离线批处理可以选精度，对在线接口则更看重延迟。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 70, "topic_id": "da0610bd-neg-zh-additive-48", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "da0610bd-1b0f-4594-b8a4-05684632afda", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-da0610bd-0069", "text": "主流程用流式处理最合适。不过仓库里也提供了一个批处理版本，如果吞吐比延迟更重要，可以直接切换过去。两个实现共用同一套解析逻辑，切换成本很低。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 70, "topic_id": "da0610bd-neg-zh-however-extra-49", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "da0610bd-1b0f-4594-b8a4-05684632afda", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
